# Skills: Design

Purpose:
  Design skills for UI/UX, visual design, taste evaluation, heuristics,
  accessibility, and design system governance. Covers frontend and
  mobile design tasks.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @intelligence/INDEX.sdd
   3  @sources.sdd
   4  @taste-evaluation.sdd
   5  @design-heuristics.sdd
   6  @visual-design.sdd
   7  @ux-patterns.sdd
   8  @accessibility.sdd
   9  @design-system.sdd
   10 @design-review.sdd
   11 @web-design-guidelines/INDEX.sdd

Modes:
  GENERATE — run Unified Design Intelligence pipeline (Stages 1-7)
  EVALUATE  — evaluate design quality
  REVIEW    — review implementation against design principles
  DISCOVER  — discover missing design skills
  APPLY     — apply design skill to current context
  AUTO      — auto-invoke on design-related tasks

Rules:
  [D1] Design skills MUST be invoked for any UI/UX/visual work.
  [D2] Design evaluation MUST produce score and evidence.
  [D3] Design review MUST check accessibility baseline.
  [D4] Anti-slop rules: avoid generic AI-generated design fingerprints.
  [D5] DESIGN.md files are source of truth for design systems.
  [D6] Design skills MUST NOT block execution; they are advisory.
  [D7] UI GENERATION MUST go through the Unified Design Intelligence
       pipeline (intelligence/INDEX.sdd) — freeform generation is BLOCKED.
  [D8] Pattern sources are LEARNED-from, never copied (sources.sdd [DSRC1]).

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd

  Resolve:
    intelligence
    sources
    taste-evaluation
    design-heuristics
    visual-design
    ux-patterns
    accessibility
    design-system
    design-review

Navigation:
  Design: @design/INDEX.sdd
  DesignIntelligence: @design/intelligence/INDEX.sdd
  DesignSources: @design/sources.sdd
  TasteEvaluation: @design/taste-evaluation.sdd
  DesignHeuristics: @design/design-heuristics.sdd
  VisualDesign: @design/visual-design.sdd
  UXPatterns: @design/ux-patterns.sdd
  Accessibility: @design/accessibility.sdd
  DesignSystem: @design/design-system.sdd
  DesignReview: @design/design-review.sdd
  WebDesignGuidelines: @web-design-guidelines/INDEX.sdd
  ImportedDesign: @imported/INDEX.sdd
  MetaDiscovery: @../meta/SKILL-DISCOVERY.sdd
  AutoInvoke: @../agent/skill-auto-invoke.sdd

State: +
